# Enquiry form delivery via Formspree (free plan).
# 1. Sign up at https://formspree.io with the email enquiries should go to.
# 2. Create a form and confirm the email Formspree sends you.
# 3. Copy the form ID (the part after /f/ in the endpoint, e.g. xabcdefg) here
#    and save this file as .env  (do not commit .env).
VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=
